          <p class="practice__body">Event models with clear ownership, delivery guarantees, idempotency and replay, for processes that cannot wait for a batch.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>event catalogue, schemas, delivery guarantees, replay runbook.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="practice offer">
          <span class="numeral practice__num">03</span>
          <h3>Hybrid and Legacy Integration Modernisation</h3>
          <p class="practice__body">File drops, scheduled jobs and point-to-point links moved to governed integration in waves, without a big-bang cutover.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>interface inventory, target patterns, migration waves.</p>
