          <h3>Interface Rationalisation and Integration Governance</h3>
          <p class="practice__body">One register of every interface, its owner, its contract and its health, and a review process that keeps it current.</p>
          <p class="practice__typical"><span class="eyebrow">Deliverables</span>interface register, ownership, standards, review process.</p>
        </article>
